$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ PARAMETERS ARE TAKEN FROM
$
$ Thermodynamic description of the Ta-W-Zr system,
$ C.Guo, C.Li, S.Shang, Z.Du, Int. J. Mater. Res., 105 (2014) 1048-1056.
$
$ 95Gui: Ta-Zr Ref.[15] 
$ Phase diagram and thermochemical properties of the Zr-Ta system  
$   An assessment based on Gibbs energy modelling,
$ A.F.Guillerment, J. Alloys Compd. , 226(1995), 174-184.
$ 
$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Comments
$ Lattice stability is taken from Unary 5.0.
$ 
$ The vertical section in Fig. 11 can not be reproduced. As other 
$ figures are OK, it is not clear the reasons why.
$                                                                         T.A.
$
$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ELEMENT /-   ELECTRON_GAS              0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00!
 ELEMENT VA   VACUUM                    0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00!
 ELEMENT TA   BCC_A2                    1.8095E+02  5.6819E+03  4.1472E+01 !
 ELEMENT W    BCC_A2                    1.8385E+02  4.9700E+03  3.2620E+01 !
 ELEMENT ZR   HCP_A3                    9.1224E+01  5.5663E+03  3.9181E+01 !

$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 TYPE_DEFINITION % SEQ *!
 DEFINE_SYSTEM_DEFAULT ELEMENT 2 !
 DEFAULT_COMMAND DEF_SYS_ELEMENT VA /- !

$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$  PARAMETERS FOR LIQUID
$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 PHASE LIQUID  %  1  1.0  !
    CONSTITUENT LIQUID  : TA,W,ZR :  !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA;0)      298.15 +3.05759080e+04 -4.56417666e+01*T -1.99635084e-02*T**2 +1.83947499e-06*T**3; 6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W;0)       298.15 +5.35197890e+04 -4.32251380e+01*T -1.97281306e-02*T**2 +1.95556900e-06*T**3; 6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,ZR;0)      298.15 +1.90238711e+04 -4.22613494e+01*T -2.33739406e-02*T**2 +2.20623418e-06*T**3; 6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,W;0)    298.15 -22711.6;                 6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,W;1)    298.15 -3504.1;                  6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,ZR;0)   298.15 +13832.1;                 6000 N ! 
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,ZR;1)   298.15 -7150;                    6000 N ! 
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W,ZR;0)    298.15 -48980+27.9599*T;         6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W,ZR;1)    298.15 -4645.4+0.7655*T;         6000 N !
  PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W,ZR;2)    298.15 -8597.1+6.1958*T;         6000 N !

$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$  PARAMETERS FOR HCP_A3
